  "measurement_source": "Baseline emitted from pristine 732505af. The timed candidate came from an independent exact-trip costing prototype on that base with OAK_NATIVE_UNROLL_SMALL=1. Its default-mode rebuild and a fresh default-mode rebuild of landed f07b5f99 emit byte-identical native objects and C companions. The prototype was discarded in favor of the landed implementation; the measurements below are independent runs, not copies of the earlier report.",
  "scope": "Only hash__blake3_ucompress is native; surrounding hash code uses the identical generated C companion. These are not whole-native application timings or final-executable proofs.",
