    "os": "macOS 26.3.1(a), Darwin arm64",
    "affinity": "uncontrolled",
    "frequency": "uncontrolled",
    "limitations": "Heavy variable shared-host load. No builds or tests from this experiment ran during timing; other sessions remained active. Three sequential runs favor the candidate but do not establish a universal speedup or consistent C parity."
  },
